{"id": "185533", "name": "partial derivatives exist but not continuous", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; direction: rtl;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">נגדיר פונקציה \\(f(x,y)&nbsp; \\) באופן הבא:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;\\( f(x,y)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}{{CT:0}} &amp; (x,y)\\neq (0,0) \\\\0 &amp; (x,y)=(0,0)\\end{array}\\right. \\)</span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">הגרף של \\(f(x,y)\\) נראה כך:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"data/185533/files/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"516\" height=\"544\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: left;\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong style=\"font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הנגזרות החלקיות של \\(f(x,y)\\) ואת ערכן בנקודה \\((0,0)\\):&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">(כדי להקליד אינסוף, הקלידו&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">inf</span>, ועל מנת להקליד מינוס אינסוף, הקלידו&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">minf.</span>&nbsp;אם הנגזרת לא קיימת הקלידו&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">nd</span>)</span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">שימו לב</span>: תשובתכן תוצג כפי שהמערכת מבינה אותה. אנא וודעו שהיא נראית כמצופה.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br>\n    </span></p>\n<table align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((x,y)\\)=</td>\n            <td>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((x,y)\\)=</td>\n            <td>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((0,0)\\)=</td>\n            <td>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((0,0)\\)=</td>\n            <td>[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">האם \\(f(x,y)\\) רציפה ב- \\(\\mathbb{R}^2\\)? [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]]</span></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>[[feedback:prt4]]<br>[[feedback:prt5]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "fx", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is correct.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is incorrect.</p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "fy", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<p>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is correct.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<p>\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is incorrect.</p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<p>Correct answer,&nbsp;\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((0,0)=0\\)</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<p>Inorrect answer. By definition</p>\n<p>&nbsp;\\( \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\( (0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(h,0)-f(0,0)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{h \\cdot0}{h^2}=0 \\)</p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-T", "feedback": "<p>Correct answer,&nbsp;\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((0,0)=0\\)</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-F", "feedback": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Inorrect answer. By definition</p>\n<p>&nbsp;\\( \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\( (0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(0,h)-f(0,0)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{0 \\cdot h}{3h^2}=0 \\)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt5", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "false", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-T", "feedback": "<p>Well done! Indeed \\(f(x,y)\\) isn't continuous at \\((0,0)\\).</p>\n<p>By taking the path \\((t,t)\\) when \\(t→0\\) we get</p>\n<p>\\( \\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{ t\\cdot t}{t^2+3t^2}=\\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\neq f(0,0) \\)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Notice,&nbsp;</strong>\\(f(x,y)\\) is an example for a function which has both partial&nbsp;derivatives at \\((0,0)\\) and they are equal, but&nbsp;\\(f(x,y)\\) iself isn't coninuous.</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-F", "feedback": "<p>Incorrect answer! Note that \\(f(x,y)\\) isn't continuous at \\((0,0)\\)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>By taking the path \\((t,t)\\) when \\(t→0\\) we get</p>\n<p>\\( \\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{ t\\cdot t}{t^2+3t^2}=\\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\neq f(0,0) \\)</p>\n<p><strong>Notice, </strong>\\(f(x,y)\\) is an example for a function which has both partial&nbsp;derivatives at \\((0,0)\\) and they are equal, but&nbsp;\\(f(x,y)\\) iself isn't coninuous.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["f", "fx", "fy"], "nvariants": 1}